<title>SPAIN: Madrid stock index climbs to new historic high.</title>
<headline>Madrid stock index climbs to new historic high.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Madrid general stock index powered higher to close at new historic highs on Thursday, boosted by advances in futures-related trade and bond market gains, dealers said. * General index up 9.21 points, 1.61 pct, to 580.87. * Ibex-35 index climbs 107.47 points, 1.64 pct, to 6,673.12.</p>
</text>
